 "description": "Bonus numbers to replace rolling many dice. 'fast': roll 5 dice (incl. Wild Die), add the die code's pips and the five_dice_bonus. 'faster': roll only the Wild Die, add pips and the wild_die_bonus. Character Point dice are rolled separately; with a Force Point, double the original die code before looking up the bonus.",
